    "verdict": "正确",
    "basis": "observed_window",
    "scope": "原文为条件性判断：电脑普及使社会通讯系统脆弱，机器故障或病毒侵入可大范围波及，有时造成大量数据丢失。回顾口径为1991年后至cutoff前公开记录的电脑/网络系统故障或恶意软件事件中是否出现广泛传播与实质数据损失；不要求每次故障均扩散。",
    "reason": "CERT-EU记录Petya样恶意软件迅速在组织内传播、可跨境扩散并造成扇区实质删除；CrowdStrike错误更新导致全球约850万台Windows设备崩溃，波及航空、银行、零售与急救服务；USENIX研究显示单一文件系统故障即可在分布式存储系统中造成数据丢失、损坏与不可用。这些直接对应原文‘大范围波及’与‘有时大量数据丢失’的主要判断。",
    "limitation": "证据多为具体事件与实验研究，不能量化‘电脑越多风险按固定比例增加’，也不证明每次故障都会扩散；原文‘有时’的量词已保留例外空间。",
    "evidence_ids": [
      "prior-f1ee5a795bca4d3ba245",
      "ev-4660f25a2a0be1e619525d1b",
      "ev-1e9275248965deced439a9ea",
      "ev-2e122599410b12f63c659658",
      "ev-8919d460747fbd3f47735ab4",
      "prior-32e4334532fb2a8766c7"
    ],
    "method": "从系统互联推断故障传播与集中依赖风险",
    "method_basis": "inferred",
    "observation_end": "2024-08-06",
    "future_time_text": "",
    "condition_state": "satisfied",
    "trend_aligned": false,
    "evidence_notes": [
      {
        "evidence_id": "prior-f1ee5a795bca4d3ba245",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "CERT-EU报告Petya样恶意软件迅速在组织内传播且可跨境扩散；发现额外擦盘行为，部分扇区被实质删除，文件加密后的恢复资料不可靠。",
        "publication_date": "2017-06-29",
        "observation_end": "2017-06-29",
        "limitation": "为已登记摘要，非全文；证明该次事件传播与数据删除，不覆盖所有病毒事件。",
        "source_availability": {
          "status": "available",
          "basis": "publication_range"
        }
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-4660f25a2a0be1e619525d1b",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "On July 19, 2024, CrowdStrike, a cybersecurity firm that delivers its products and services via a cloud computing platform, released a software update with a defective file for devices using the Windows operating system, causing some Windows devices to crash.",
        "publication_date": "2024-07-24",
        "observation_end": "2024-07-20",
        "limitation": "正文截断；摘要称约850万台Windows设备受影响、低于全部Windows设备1%，属单次事件，不能代表所有故障。",
        "publication_date_status": "unconfirmed_by_source_metadata",
        "source_availability": {
          "status": "available",
          "basis": "program_capture"
        }
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-1e9275248965deced439a9ea",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "Microsoft estimates the outage affected 8.5 million Windows devices. Microsoft notes that this number makes up less than one percent of all Windows machines.",
        "publication_date": null,
        "observation_end": "2024-08-06",
        "limitation": "CISA页面元数据无发表日期，仅有最后修订日期；正文截断，且为官方通报，证明事件规模而非因果机制。",
        "source_availability": {
          "status": "available",
          "basis": "program_capture"
        }
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-2e122599410b12f63c659658",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "The major result of our study is that a single file-system fault introduced in one node of the cluster can induce catastrophic outcomes such as data loss, corruption, and unavailability.",
        "publication_date": null,
        "observation_end": null,
        "limitation": "期刊页面无发表日期元数据；为实验研究，证明技术可能性而非生产环境普遍发生率。",
        "source_availability": {
          "status": "available",
          "basis": "program_capture"
        }
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "ev-8919d460747fbd3f47735ab4",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "We find that modern distributed systems do not consistently use redundancy to recover from file-system faults: a single file-system fault can cause catastrophic outcomes such as data loss, corruption, and unavailability.",
        "publication_date": null,
        "observation_end": null,
        "limitation": "会议论文PDF，元数据无发表日期；实验条件与生产部署存在差异。",
        "source_availability": {
          "status": "available",
          "basis": "program_capture"
        }
      },
      {
        "evidence_id": "prior-32e4334532fb2a8766c7",
        "relation": "support",
        "quote": "GAO记录CrowdStrike错误软件更新造成数百万Windows系统故障，影响航空与医院；同时回顾SolarWinds攻击，讨论供应链相互依赖的系统脆弱性。",
        "publication_date": "2024-09-23",
        "observation_end": "2024-09-23",
        "limitation": "为已登记摘要，非全文；概括性记录，未给出逐项数据损失统计。",
        "source_availability": {
          "status": "available",
          "basis": "publication_range"
        }
      }
    ],
    "remaining_gap": "缺少覆盖1991年后长时段、系统性的全球故障与数据损失统计，无法量化‘电脑普及程度’与脆弱性的比例关系；现有证据足以支持原文条件性主要判断。"
  },
